# Performance

Full audit: `docs/performance-report.md` (2026-07-20). **No UI/theme regressions** when optimizing.

## High-impact patterns (keep)

- Fetch **full notifications list** only when the user opens the bell; keep lightweight unread-count polling separately.
- `next/dynamic` for: mini player, AI FAB, right sidebar, watch-page AI/Q&A/comments/resources.
- Font subset: Poppins **400–700** only (avoid loading 100–900).
- Video `preload="metadata"` until user plays.
- React Query: `refetchOnWindowFocus: false` default; taxonomy `staleTime` ~10 minutes.

## Deferred (need larger refactors)

- Converting `(app)/layout` to RSC-heavy tree.
- Merging home `dashboard` + `recommendations` APIs.
- Shrinking Prisma `include` on list endpoints without DTO contract changes.
- Vendor chunk size (~1.4MB Ant Design + framework) — route splits only mitigate.

## Backend

- Explore/recommendations: multiple Prisma reads per request — consider caching later, not in drive-by PRs.
- Elasticsearch optional; default local dev uses `SEARCH_PROVIDER=postgres`.

## Profiling

Use React DevTools Profiler and Network tab for before/after claims; document measurable deltas in `docs/performance-report.md` when making new optimizations.
